    "VariantLayout": {"oneOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"tag":{"const":"unit"}},"required":["tag"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"tag":{"const":"tuple"},"elements":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Type"}}},"required":["tag","elements"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"tag":{"const":"named"},"match":{"enum":["exact","contains"]},"ordered":{"type":"boolean"},"fields":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/FieldRequirement"}}},"required":["tag","match","ordered","fields"],"additionalProperties":false}]},
